29) Service Layer ( @Service )
      Service Layer contains the business logic. It processes data and calls the repository layer.

30) Repository Layer ( @Repository )
      Repository Layer interacts with the database and perform CRUD operations.

31) Entity Layer
      Entity layer contains the classes that represent databases tables. Each object of the entity class represents one row in the database table.

